# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe node882
node882 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>cwe</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;[Common Weakness Enumeration](https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/common_weakness_enumeration). A reference to a source of software flaws defined within the official [CWE List](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/) that conforms to the [CWE specification](https://cwe.mitre.org/).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
